  "releaseNotes": "#  (2026-02-20)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Add MixedModeProfile test to main solution file (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/70776c03b394cda7f1c6143fbe91454b1cff685a)\n* Address review feedback for ParseUnoConfigFields and GetUnoConfig (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/397684118f702b8f84db81f51c2ceb278a327853)\n* Address review feedback on VersionChecker tests and CI gate (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/5225b475811305cb127a37e90dba48d2bdb0c44f)\n* Adjust `WasmShellEnableEmccProfiling` support (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/5a73c989c7ba12801d0467348e4789bf29586629)\n* Adjust dotnet.js loading for cache busting (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/3efbf09dc7d8652441175feaef6d3f60dd2c8120)\n* Adjust emscripten version (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/d9a71325a1c9a6b2141e6e7293c7f076b0c37108)\n* Adjust fingerprint publishing for dotnet.js (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/791dd7bcfea7531bbb212e6af009d980a943f848)\n* Adjust fingerprinting for workers (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/b6be1dd4dd8d5eefe61e56e3fb9faf8dc076b6d1)\n* Adjust fingerprinting update on output override (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/e607d57013171b9b7618d782ad8883b34abd6ae2)\n* Adjust for publish incorrect rename of dotnet.js fingerprint (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/5f2f914e3c158e536a4eb6f3fd90616cb951c932)\n* Adjust HR for 17.12.4 and later (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/cc3fe7225f9d8502a35434b995e1d19ccff43ea5)\n* Adjust support for linked assets (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/c057981d8fdd5dcd1b6006677c6ea0badc21066c)\n* Adjust workaround for https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/d455fcc19a79cd1da05726c124d1a9e387550456)\n* Do not crash in case of a customized loader (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/7ec77b83fa071702d13aa06f43d4b0c54e066333)\n* don't prefix uno-assets path with the package folder for compatibility (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/347615126bc8327bccaed7b728152ee29f3023e1)\n* Ensure explicit dependency for manifest generation (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/c6a7e9902ed965a3915e4d4672ccdb7e4bfb1d40)\n* Ensure that build native is set with native references (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/5e842b689013adf5b5c477540c651aa10194614b)\n* Generate AOT profile debug list regardless of exclusion settings (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/c65eeba4cb2685d87bca0aefd686951969620d8f)\n* Generate AOT profile debug list regardless of exclusion settings (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/2b5ed8a88d20f239d57c1a038a1a94b7d334362c)\n* Initialize progress variables in constructor and add array validation (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/7d6e66471516f8389b6ceae94c04447b364dc1e6)\n* list all assemblies (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/7c42885e327013499d112b5b82c0de886e7ad600)\n* Make test actually use Newtonsoft.Json and fix profile configuration (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/2160d6393d9089fd0b656bc478b337804d903df1)\n* Pass MonoRuntimeMixedModeExcludedAssembly as item group (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/27a85f7b28aa8c17a2ebac5d455aa33c87586287)\n* Raise an error when wasm-tools are missing (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/a878e745912adf827cb0343a218b17986a6d9d19)\n* Remove test from slnf and fix validation timing (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/ddecc5fb090dee30252124ddaeb07446c59db18e)\n* **res:** Fix invalid loading of satellite assemblies with WasmShellLoadAllSatelliteResources (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/f2df70c6937291cdf18ffd4890d5caaadf03a36c)\n* Rewrite relative paths to absolute for server project dependencies (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/74a46c5f2726f65d358a111532879e4b0b537ab8)\n* **service-worker:** Enhance error handling and caching logic (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/261a601b38998d3a1a3d5e43a314e8e03bd3a0fb)\n* Set executable permission on validate-boot-config.sh (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/80b48579d70f07381cfc010dfd590c731535d3de)\n* Support modern .NET 8+ boot config in UnoWasmChecker (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/3050b5d44cb8684d079920ef8c1de5a15491b32c)\n* Update service worker to use dotnet.js instead of dotnet.boot.js for .NET 10 compatibility (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/e0103746285ce78f8a55d1254a3aa2673389dc55)\n* Update uno-config.js path in offline_files to include PackageAssetsFolder (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/1f88e8063eff0e63d3e5998e32a24314dfecac2a)\n* Use Math.max instead of Math.min for initial progress target (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/dc2b57ecc052fe065d68421985b9296a8e7c6bb2)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* Add equal left and right margins to progress bar (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/3463f45f2d206b5560a552c897ac7510dc3196bf)\n* Add support for WasmShellNativeFileReference (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/e0cafbe2bd70fdfa407911853ade8f236164dbc0)\n* Add support generic wasm apps (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/a8e6dbf0d33b5dc094682b9fd059acad97a35191)\n* Add WasmShellEnableIDBFS support (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/48dd61e2b4c215e2f0a81b14330eee97592cb028)\n* Adjust progress bar behavior (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/d575f3e8ee44f2981b5927de91acc6b965ebb482)\n* Bump to net10 (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/077cf0bb1e9b3d1479d8decf77fa8c77d518a838)\n* Improve WASM splash screen UX with better progress bar styling (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/6f3077e871a62664e9a930dfa086e82e5fdba559)\n* Initialize progress bar with best-guess estimation from MonoConfig assets (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/1fd5dbcee91ef9f81a8e2aa207cd47522a698013)\n* Reduce progress bar to 4px height with 2px corner radius (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/cde90c9f75007a0608af786c7fd5ca43f3e94e2c)\n* **service-worker:** Add fetch retry mechanism and environment variable support (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/5a1aeda5fa9129c6369a03211600ef21d0cda977)\n* Update progress bar to 8px margins and https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/3fe3bc002af9bb0912b7095821db01ec9dca598a)\n* Upgrade require.js from 2.3.6 to 2.3.8 (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/45046c52a2a3662f4786ce468f4c34b7f8e67d54)\n\n\n### Performance Improvements\n\n* Adust parallelism (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/8df147796ef188bbd6ec03fca990b040a350db82)\n* Improve background worker concurrency (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/9a7e240d4538e009072b75de6bc826442cae86bd)\n* More parallelism (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/c9b8bf410d8151328c7cd45b7f282dc63a552383)\n* Paralellize more (https://github.com/unoplatform/Uno.Wasm.Bootstrap/commit/20b43f4fa0824540e1734b57b2320e7c1282958e)",
